.owner-key.previous

# The C/17 pages are back on the site (27 Sep 2026): the assessor needs to
# reach the pack on Tuesday, and Drive will not display an HTML file as a
# page. They carry no working key -- the one that was published is rotated
# and dead, and the page reads any key from the address.
#
# THE RULE THAT STANDS: never commit a working key into these files. That is
# what made C/17's grades readable by anyone who found this public repo.

